radix (51.0.0~rc2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add a "Bit Flip Frequency" preference (0-100%, default 12%) for the
    random bit flip feature, persisted between sessions.
  * Replace the application icon with the owner-provided calculator-tile
    artwork and regenerate the hicolor icon sizes.

